case plan_database_failure

== failure on the second plan
status: 503
header Cache-Control: no-store
header Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
header Content-Type: application/json
header Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
header Retry-After: 5
header Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
header X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
header X-Frame-Options: DENY
header X-Request-Id: <rid>
body: {"error":"the database is unavailable; send the same request again","request_id":"<rid>"}
<eof>

== state of user:a
stored plan plan:good
pending 
lease held: false

== metrics moved
imports/error +1
items/plan/created +1
seconds/observations +1

== log lines
train import result=error plans=2 sessions=1 created=1 unchanged=0 updated=0 rejected=0 days=0 level=INFO
request failed status=503 level=ERROR
http status=503 code=<nil> route=POST /v1/train/import
